abstract: >-
  A curated, vendor-neutral reference to the Physical-AI landscape: deep
  profiles of edge-AI and datacenter chip companies (NVIDIA, Intel, Qualcomm,
  Hailo, SiMa.ai, Axelera, Blaize, DeepX, MemryX, Mythic, EnCharge, Ambarella,
  Groq, Tenstorrent), an architecture-philosophy taxonomy, precision-labeled
  hardware comparison tables, coverage of vision-language-action (VLA) and
  world foundation models, applications by vertical, and sourced market data.
